    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Using the bilty as a master checklist, each item is marked off, and any variance—such as missing parts, extra units, or mismatched specifications—is recorded and reported to the project manager for rapid resolution. This step ensures complete accountability and provides a clear audit trail for the client.</p>
