    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once uncrated, all electrical and mechanical components undergo functional testing. Power tools are plugged in, switches are toggled, and moving parts are exercised to verify that they operate within manufacturer tolerances. Test results are logged, and any defective units are isolated for replacement or repair.</p>
